				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>New analysis from <a href="https://yougov.co.uk/news/2015/07/29/one-direction-gay-popular/" target="_blank">YouGov Profiles</a> data reveals that, among adult fans, <strong>Madonna</strong> is the 3rd music act with the strongest correlation to UK gay men.</p>
<p>Using data from the YouGov Cube – our connected data vault of over 120,000 different data points, collected from over 200,000 UK adults &#8211; they compared British men who identify as gay to the rest of the population and pulled out the music artists that are most disproportionately popular among them. One Direction is now the most standout feature of gay mens&#8217; music tastes, ahead of Kylie and <strong>Madonna</strong>.</p>
<img class="alignnone" src="https://d25d2506sfb94s.cloudfront.net/cumulus_uploads/inlineimage/13063/Gaymusicicons2015.png" alt="" width="771" height="1939" />
<p>Read more: <strong><a href="https://yougov.co.uk/news/2015/07/29/one-direction-gay-popular/" target="_blank">YouGov</a></strong>.</p>
